{"last_link_id": 68, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [67, 68], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [376.00146484375, 626.3565673828125], "pos": [490.9125671386719, 1286.8211669921875], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "你是一个视频提示词高级工程师，按照我的这个格式解析下这个视频。\n\n0-2秒：品牌初见与质感建立 采用中景（Medium Shot）开场，主体呈现极致的商业写实（Commercial Realism）风格。模特通过自然的展示动作（如轻抚产品或整理衣物）建立亲和力。画面侧重于展现产品的材质纹理（Texture Detail）与面料/外壳的物理垂坠感，背景采用简约的高级灰或品牌色场景，营造出4K/8K工业级渲染的奢华质感。\n\n2-5秒：细节下沉与光影雕琢 镜头执行平稳的推进（Push-in）。随着距离拉近，光影重心转向产品的表面反射（Reflections）与漫反射细节，呈现出高端材质的细腻触感。采用环形布光（Ring Lighting）结合强烈的轮廓光（Rim Light），勾勒出产品的边缘线条，将主体从背景中立体剥离，展现出极强的工业设计空间感。\n\n5-8秒：微距特写与功能触达 镜头最终锁定在局部特写（Macro/Close-up）。触发极浅景深（Shallow DoF），使背景环境完全虚化。重点聚焦于产品的核心LOGO、精细接缝或关键功能组件（如精密按键、皮肤纹理、液体质地）。整体风格达到视觉顶点，融合了**电影级锐度（Cinematic Sharpness）**与平滑的动态模糊，极具商业说服力。\n\n风格关键词\n视觉流派： 商业写实（Commercial Realism）、工业设计摄影（Industrial Design Photography）、8K高清（Ultra-HD）。\n\n光影氛围： 影棚专业布光（Studio Lighting）、全局照明（Global Illumination）、高动态范围（HDR）、轮廓光（Rim Light）。\n\n后期质感： 锐利聚焦（Sharp Focus）、极简主义（Minimalism）、无损渲染（Lossless Rendering）。", "这是一个5秒的视频", 0.6, 543418610, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 65, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 66, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 67, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [441.6000061035156, 153.3000030517578], "pos": [904.9912109375, 1282.500732421875], "widgets_values": ["", "", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 67, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "id": 65, "type": "easy saveText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [430.90966796875, 418.1369934082031], "pos": [912.6983032226562, 1492.4078369140625], "widgets_values": ["没问题，作为视频提示词高级工程师，我将为您深度解析这段12秒的母婴/家居类产品商业短片。该视频通过细腻的色彩管理和温润的光影，成功塑造了品牌的高级感与亲和力。\n\n以下是详细的解析报告：\n\n### **0-3秒：品牌初见与质感建立**\n采用**中景（Medium Shot）**开场，画面聚焦在排列整齐的硅胶蘑菇玩具上。主体呈现出**莫兰迪色系（Morandi Color Palette）**的商业写实风格。通过静态的展示，强调了产品表面的**哑光磨砂质感（Matte Texture）**，这种非反光材质传递出一种安全、高级的触感。背景采用柔和的居家自然光，营造出4K工业级的温馨氛围，初步建立起“环保、安全、美学”的品牌第一印象。\n\n### **3-8秒：交互体验与动态叙事**\n镜头切换至**近景（Close-up）**，引入模特（儿童）的自然交互动作。通过孩子叠放玩具的动作，展示了产品的**结构逻辑（Structural Design）**与物理稳定性。光影重心转向自然光下的**漫反射（Diffuse Reflection）**，光线在硅胶表面均匀铺开，去除了生硬的阴影。镜头伴随轻微的**平移（Pan）**，捕捉孩子专注的表情与灵活的动作，将产品的功能性（锻炼精细动作）与情感价值（创造性游戏）完美融合。\n\n### **8-12秒：微距特写与多维展示**\n镜头锁定在**俯视微距特写（Top-down Macro）**。触发**极浅景深（Shallow DoF）**，使周边的家居环境完全虚化，视线集中在拆解后的产品组件上。重点展示了产品的**工业细节（Industrial Details）**：无缝拼接工艺、圆润的边缘处理以及多层次的嵌套结构。整体风格在结尾达到视觉平衡，融合了**电影级柔焦（Cinematic Soft Focus）**与高饱和度的生活化色彩，极具商业说服力与品牌感染力。\n\n---\n\n### **风格关键词**\n\n**视觉流派：** \n北欧简约风（Scandinavian Minimalism）、母婴产品摄影（Baby Product Photography）、4K/8K高清画质。\n\n**光影氛围：** \n自然窗光模拟（Natural Window Light）、高调照明（High-key Lighting）、柔和阴影（Soft Shadows）、温暖色温（Warm Color Temperature）。\n\n**后期质感：** \n丝滑动态（Smooth Motion）、低对比度高宽容度（Low Contrast/High Dynamic Range）、柔和锐化（Soft Sharpening）、治愈系调色（Healing Color Grading）。\n\n---\n\n这份解析不仅还原了视频的视觉流程，还从工程角度拆解了其光影与构图逻辑，非常适合作为AI视频生成（如Sora, Runway Gen-2）的提示词参考模板。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 68, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 66, "type": "JjkShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkShowText"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "图片", "label": "图片", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"name": "宽", "label": "宽", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽"}, {"name": "高", "label": "高", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高"}, {"name": "音频", "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}, {"name": "easy showAnything output", "label": "easy showAnything output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "easy showAnything output"}, {"name": "easy showAnything 6 output", "label": "easy showAnything 6 output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "easy showAnythin